trix is $T.$ Which of the following should be placed into the blank space to make a true statement?" :question/worked-solution "Recall that the *invertible matrix theorem* (in terms of linear transformations) states the following: \n\n $T$ is a $\\text{bijection}$ $\\,⟺\\,{\\,\\begin{aligned} & \\text{Im}(T)={R}^{n} \\\\  & \\text{rank}(T)=n \\\\  & \\text{Ker}(T)={0} \\\\  & \\text{nullity}(T)=0\\end{aligned}$ \n$\\,⟺\\,$  $T$ is invertible\n\nTherefore, the missing expression is \"bijection\"." :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "q-141454/selection/0a940c4caf2faefd065f7216b9211efc7e794801e456861d75356950af071920" :answer/id #uuid "a89e4496-6911-5903-b541-99fd57a9776f" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$\\text{Null}(T)$ and $\\text{Ker}(T)$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-141454/selection/ff7d3bf8f918673045c963941ac44c01609e3679c3ef1b0fc171dc4428335110" :answer/id #uuid "667525ec-a247-5b8d-ad2a-3e434de44645" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$\\text{Domain}(T)$ and $\\text{Range}(T)$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-141454/selection/8f7015ed701f7d11f23e53423f1132d77ec8da4644cc1c303f631265366bd38f" :answer/id #uuid "d16b5107-ad7f-5058-97b8-85a017d106d3" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$\\text{Ker}(T)$ and $\\text{Domain}(T)$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-141454/selection/3821ca84f4629a18ab09024d5e003c9cca18280eba15517da33633e2bcc53c04" :answer/id #uuid "f4a0eae5-a171-549c-a726-a9a777708ea7" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$\\text{Im}(T)$ and $\\text{Ker}(T)$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-141454/selection/3c22b88e71f56704e0e7309e8933b570c643f6cd9c46c5e9c6647321a919156d" :answer/id #uuid "03502f79-1d4b-5ad4-b08d-1e85fecb327e" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$\\text{Im}(T)$ and $\\text{det}(T)$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-141454/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "cd8ceb31-7b4c-5108-936e-3a99